    "title": "Garnet Valley High School standout Aidan Bendo's collegiate team lost game in the NCAA Division III Football Championship on Saturday, Dec. 13 - South Delco News",
    "text": "On Saturday, Dec. 13, former Garnet Valley High School standout Aidan Bendo’s current collegiate team the Susquehanna Riverhawks lost 10-40 against the Johns Hopkins Blue Jays in the NCAA Division III Football Championship.\nThe game took place at Homewood Field at 12 p.m. and was the first matchup against the Johns Hopkins Blue Jays in the tournament.\nAidan Bendo — Freshman — 6′2″ — 250 — Hometown: Garnet Valley",
